1
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,780
(Sheldon:)Leonard, are you in the shower?

2
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:09,920
I can't hear you!
I'm in the shower!

3
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,050
(Sheldon:)I asked if you
were in the shower,

4
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:14,020
but that's moot now!

5
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,190
(Leonard:)What?

6
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:20,030
Moot! Rendered unimportant
by recent events!

7
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:22,580
I can't hear you!
I'm in the shower!

8
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:24,400
(Sheldon:)I have to skip
the chitchat.

9
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,670
(Sheldon:)Emergency.

10
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:27,530
(Leonard:)What kind of
emergency?

11
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:30,170
(Sheldon:)Mathematical--
32-ounce banana smoothie,

12
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:32,240
(Sheldon:)16-ounce bladder.

13
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,810
(Leonard:)You might not
want to do that.

14
00:00:34,810 --> 00:00:36,540
(Sheldon:)I assure you I do.

15
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:39,150
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I'm not alone in here.

16
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:41,100
What?!

17
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:43,950
(Priya:)Hello, Sheldon.

18
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:45,420
(Sheldon:)What are you doing in there?

19
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:46,690
She can't be in here!

20
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:49,360
We were in here first;
you can't be in here.

21
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,020
(Sheldon:)According to
the roommate agreement,

22
00:00:51,030 --> 00:00:52,490
(Sheldon:)paragraph nine, subsection B,

23
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:54,230
"The right
to bathroom privacy

24
00:00:54,230 --> 00:00:56,530
(Sheldon:)is suspended in the event
of force majeure."

25
00:00:56,530 --> 00:00:58,200
(Sheldon:)And believe me,
I am experiencing

26
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:01,140
a very majeure force.

27
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:03,640
(Sheldon:)Come on, you can't
wait two minutes?

28
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:06,570
(Priya:)Oh, Leonard,
let the man pee.

29
00:01:11,310 --> 00:01:14,010
Penny? Penny?

30
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:15,680
(Sheldon:)Penny?

31
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:17,080
(Leonard:)What?

32
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:19,290
(Sheldon:)Move. Move. Move!

33
00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:24,480
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

